{"id":"b8eaf43a040e88b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-effective-rational-coding.md","title":"Effective Rational Coding","display":"df-effective-rational-coding — Effective Rational Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-effective-rational-coding","aliases":["58-df-effective-rational-coding"],"display":"df-effective-rational-coding — Effective Rational Coding","depends_on":["[[58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-effective-rational-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-effective-rational-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-rational-coding — Effective Rational Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,k,n\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b,k,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_n\\in\\mathbb Q\">\\(q_n\\in\\mathbb Q\\)</span>；自然配对及其投影来自内部编号文件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rat}\">\\(\\operatorname{rat}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_n\">\\(q_n\\)</span> 为下式固定的函数或值，不是自由选择的枚举。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> 采用本书已给出的嵌入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k+1)\\coloneqq-(k+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k+1)\\coloneqq-(k+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rat}(n)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(\\operatorname{PairLeft}_{58}(n))}\n{\\operatorname{PairRight}_{58}(n)+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rat}(n)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(\\operatorname{PairLeft}_{58}(n))}\n{\\operatorname{PairRight}_{58}(n)+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rat}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rat}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{rat}(n)=q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{rat}(n)=q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b,k\\rangle_\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b),k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle a,b,k\\rangle_\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b),k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>非单射的有理枚举足以表示统一有理逼近；每个分母均为正，符号由自然数奇偶编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,k,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"q_n\\in\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rat}","display":false},{"tex":"q_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(2k+1)\\coloneqq-(k+1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rat}(n)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\operatorname{IntCodeValue}_{58}(\\operatorname{PairLeft}_{58}(n))}\n{\\operatorname{PairRight}_{58}(n)+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"q_n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rat}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{rat}(n)=q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle a,b,k\\rangle_\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b),k).","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"42cfcb11f4e2b586","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_o